+The MACROS lump is an optional entry in the list of supported UDMF lumps.
+It is expected to come in the same format as the original MACROS lump of the
+Doom 64 binary map format. It may only be used in the Doom 64 namespace.
+
+The SCRIPTS lump is an additional companion to the BEHAVIOR or MACROS lumps.
+It is comprised of the respective uncompiled ACS or BLAM code. Stored locally
+for debugging and documentation purposes, it is not used at runtime.
 
